{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03888","headline":"使至汴州喜逢宋之问 · 李夔","name":"使至汴州喜逢宋之问","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阮籍蓬池上，孤韵竹林才。\n巨源从吏道，正拥使车来。\n相逢且交臂，相命且衔杯。\n醉後长歌毕，余声绕吹台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李夔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}